@startuml sequence-seat-decorator
title Sequence: Seat Add-on Stacking via Decorator (Iteration 4)\n(red = iteration 4 additions)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888
hide footbox
autonumber

actor Member
participant "SeatController\n(JavaFX)" as UI
participant "ExtraLegroomDecorator" as D2 #FFCCCC
participant "WindowSeatDecorator" as D1 #FFCCCC
participant "BaseSeatView\n<<ConcreteComponent>>" as C #FFCCCC

Member -> UI : choose window + extra legroom
activate UI
note over UI,C #FFF0F0
  chain built at runtime:
  new ExtraLegroomDecorator(new WindowSeatDecorator(new BaseSeatView(seat)))
end note
UI -[#CC0000]> D2 : getSurcharge()
activate D2
D2 -[#CC0000]> D1 : component.getSurcharge()
activate D1
D1 -[#CC0000]> C : component.getSurcharge()
activate C
C --> D1 : base (0)
deactivate C
D1 --> D2 : base + window extra
deactivate D1
D2 --> UI : base + window + legroom (accumulated)
deactivate D2
UI --> Member : total surcharge + labels
deactivate UI
@enduml
